# Real-scan calibration folder: client scans and everything derived from
# them (label pages, overlays, reports) must never be committed. Only the
# instructions and the blank template are tracked. See eval/real/README.md.
eval/real/*
!eval/real/README.md
!eval/real/TEMPLATE.json
